avs-cd N/FieldsOfGloryAGA
IF NOT EXISTS WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA
  makedir WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA
  copy #? WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA/ ALL CLONE QUIET
ENDIF
cd WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA
stack >NIL: 30000
assign FOG1: WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA
assign FOG2: WHDSaves:FieldsOfGloryAGA
FOG >NIL:
assign FOG1: REMOVE
assign FOG2: REMOVE
